r-the-hypnagogic-state","className":"font-body text-sm text-grey-DEFAULT hover:text-orange-DEFAULT transition-colors flex items-baseline gap-2","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-mono text-[0.5rem] text-orange-DEFAULT/80","children":["03","."]}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Step 2: Enter the Hypnagogic State"}]]}]}],["$","li","step-3-enter-the-scene",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#step-3-enter-the-scene","className":"font-body text-sm text-grey-DEFAULT hover:text-orange-DEFAULT transition-colors flex items-baseline gap-2","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-mono text-[0.5rem] text-orange-DEFAULT/80","children":["04","."]}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Step 3: Enter the Scene"}]]}]}],["$","li","step-4-loop-gently",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#step-4-loop-gently","className":"font-body text-sm text-grey-DEFAULT hover:text-orange-DEFAULT transition-colors flex items-baseline gap-2","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-mono text-[0.5rem] text-orange-DEFAULT/80","children":["05","."]}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Step 4: Loop Gently"}]]}]}],["$","li","step-5-fall-asleep-in-the-scene",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#step-5-fall-asleep-in-the-scene","className":"font-body text-sm text-grey-DEFAULT hover:text-orange-DEFAULT transition-colors flex items-baseline gap-2","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-mono text-[0.5rem] text-orange-DEFAULT/80","children":["06","."]}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Step 5: Fall Asleep in the Scene"}]]}]}],["$","li","troubleshooting",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#troubleshooting","className":"font-body text-sm text-grey-DEFAULT hover:text-orange-DEFAULT transition-colors flex items-baseline gap-2","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-mono text-[0.5rem] text-orange-DEFAULT/80","children":["07","."]}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Troubleshooting"}]]}]}]]}]]}],[["$","h2","0",{"id":"prerequisites-what-you-actually-need","className":"scroll-mt-24 font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-[0.03em] text-white mt-12 mb-4","children":"Prerequisites: What You Actually Need"}],["$","ul","1",{"className":"flex flex-col gap-3 my-6","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["A bed (or any comfortable place to lie down)"]}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["10 minutes before sleep"]}]]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["A chosen scene (one moment that implies your wish fulfilled)"]}]]}]]}],["$","p","2",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["That's it. No crystals. No special music. No expensive courses. SATS is free, available every night, and requires nothing but your own consciousness."]}],["$","h2","3",{"id":"step-1-choose-your-scene-do-this-before-bed","className":"scroll-mt-24 font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-[0.03em] text-white mt-12 mb-4","children":"Step 1: Choose Your Scene (Do This Before Bed)"}],["$","p","4",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["This is the most important step, and it happens ",["$","em","1",{"className":"text-white/90 italic","children":"before"}]," you lie down."]}],["$","p","5",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["Choose a single brief scene — one moment in time that implies your desire has already manifested. The scene should be:"]}],["$","ul","6",{"className":"flex flex-col gap-3 my-6","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"text-white font-semibold","children":"Specific."}]," Not \"I am successful\" but \"I am holding my first book with my name on the cover.\""]}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"text-white font-semibold","children":"Implied."}]," The scene should imply the fulfilled desire, not show you getting it. Not the moment of receiving, but a moment ",["$","em","3",{"className":"text-white/90 italic","children":"after"}],"."]}]]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"text-white font-semibold","children":"First-person."}]," You are in the scene, not watching it."]}]]}],["$","li","3",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"text-white font-semibold","children":"Emotionally resonant."}]," When you mentally step into the scene, you should feel something shift in your body."]}]]}]]}],["$","ul","7",{"className":"flex flex-col gap-3 my-6","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Someone congratulating you on your promotion"]}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Looking at your bank balance and feeling the quiet satisfaction of abundance"]}]]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Waking up next to the person you love"]}]]}],["$","li","3",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Unlocking the door of your new home"]}]]}]]}],["$","p","8",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["Keep the same scene for at least 30 days. Consistency is more powerful than variety."]}],["$","h2","9",{"id":"step-2-enter-the-hypnagogic-state","className":"scroll-mt-24 font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-[0.03em] text-white mt-12 mb-4","children":"Step 2: Enter the Hypnagogic State"}],["$","p","10",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["Lie down in your usual sleep position. Close your eyes."]}],["$","p","11",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["Begin a slow body scan: start at your feet and consciously release each muscle group upward. Feet. Calves. Thighs. Hips. Stomach. Chest. Shoulders. Arms. Hands. Neck. Face."]}],["$","p","12",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["You're not meditating — you're cooperating with the body's natural relaxation response. Don't force anything. This usually takes 3-5 minutes."]}],["$","ul","13",{"className":"flex flex-col gap-3 my-6","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Your thoughts begin to drift and feel less controlled"]}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["You start to see brief, fleeting images (hypnagogic imagery)"]}]]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Your body feels heavy or distant"]}]]}],["$","li","3",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Time starts to feel slippery"]}]]}]]}],["$","h2","14",{"id":"step-3-enter-the-scene","className":"scroll-mt-24 font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-[0.03em] text-white mt-12 mb-4","children":"Step 3: Enter the Scene"}],["$","p","15",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["Once you feel the shift into the hypnagogic state, gently bring your chosen scene to mind."]}],["$","p","16",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["Don't force it with effort. Invite it like a familiar memory. You've practiced this scene enough times that it should arrive easily."]}],["$","p","17",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["Step into the scene from the inside. Feel the ground under your feet if you're standing. Feel the texture of whatever you're touching. Hear any sounds. Notice the emotional tone — that settled, satisfied quality of the wish fulfilled."]}],["$","h2","18",{"id":"step-4-loop-gently","className":"scroll-mt-24 font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-[0.03em] text-white mt-12 mb-4","children":"Step 4: Loop Gently"}],["$","p","19",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["Don't play the scene once and wait. Loop it — gently, without urgency — like a song you love playing on repeat."]}],["$","p","20",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["The scene should be short enough to loop naturally. 15-30 seconds is ideal. If your scene is too long, you'll find yourself analyzing it rather than feeling it."]}],["$","p","21",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["Each time through, lean into the feeling more than the imagery. The feeling is the instruction. The imagery is just the delivery mechanism."]}],["$","h2","22",{"id":"step-5-fall-asleep-in-the-scene","className":"scroll-mt-24 font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-[0.03em] text-white mt-12 mb-4","children":"Step 5: Fall Asleep in the Scene"}],["$","p","23",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["Your goal is to fall asleep while still in the scene — or as close to it as possible. The last conscious impression you carry into sleep is the most deeply planted."]}],["$","p","24",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["If your mind wanders (and it will), gently return to the scene without frustration. Wandering is not failure. It is the nature of the hypnagogic state."]}],["$","h2","25",{"id":"troubleshooting","className":"scroll-mt-24 font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-[0.03em] text-white mt-12 mb-4","children":"Troubleshooting"}],["$","p","26",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"text-white font-semibold","children":"\"I fall asleep before I can even start the scene.\""}],"\nDo SATS earlier — right when you lie down, before you're too drowsy. Or try a brief SATS session in the early morning, when you wake but aren't fully alert."]}],["$","p","27",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"text-white font-semibold","children":"\"My mind keeps analyzing whether it's working.\""}],"\nThis is the critical factor still active. It means you're not yet in the hypnagogic state. Go back to Step 2 and spend more time on the body relaxation."]}],["$","p","28",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"text-white font-semibold","children":"\"I can't visualize clearly.\""}],"\nClarity of imagery is not required. What matters is the feeling. Some people do SATS with virtually no imagery and excellent results. Lean entirely into the emotional tone."]}],["$","p","29",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"text-white font-semibold","children":"\"How long before I see results?\""}],"\nThis varies. Some people see results within days. Others within 30-90 days. Remember the echo delay — current reality is a projection of past consciousness. Be patient with the bridge."]}]],["$","section",null,{"aria-labelledby":"faq-heading","className":"mt-16 pt-10 border-t border-white/10","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[0.52rem] tracking-[0.25em] uppercase text-orange-DEFAULT mb-2","children":[["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":13,"height":13,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle-help","children":[["$","circle","1mglay",{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"}],["$","path","1u773s",{"d":"M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 